{"_note":"星级分布卡(v40):最新 N 条评论(≤50)按 5★→1★ 五行,每行 = 标签 + 轨道 + 填充(百分比 p 数据层算好)+ 条数;脚注给条数与最新均分。dist/rvN/rvAvg 来自 page/flow/reviews.df。rvN=0(该区没上架 / 没人评 / 评论源这次没给,三者分不开,文案用中性的「暂时没有拿到」)渲一行空态,卡高由数据层 distH 二选一(150/64)。这是「详细的评分列表」的第一块 —— lookup 只给总均分,评论 RSS 才看得见分布。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"bg","type":"layer","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"{parent.h}","bgColor":"#FFFFFF|#15171A","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"14pt","leftB":"14pt","rightT":"14pt","rightB":"14pt"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_n","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[ge::(${_n},1)]"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"forEach","props":{"items":"${dist}","key":"_it","index":"_i"},"react":[{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_ry","value":"$[calc::(14+${_i}*22)]"}},{"type":"op","action":"set","props":{"key":"_p","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${_it.p},0)]"}},{"type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"${_ry}pt","w":"34pt","h":"18pt","text":"${_it.s} ★","fontSize":"10.5pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1","alignmentV":"1"},{"type":"layer","x":"56pt","y":"${_ry}pt+6pt","w":"{parent.w}-136pt","h":"6pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"3pt","leftB":"3pt","rightT":"3pt","rightB":"3pt"},"bgColor":"#E7E9EE|#20232A"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(${_p},1),if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.s},5),3),1,0),0)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"56pt","y":"${_ry}pt+6pt","w":"({parent.w}-136pt)*${_p}/100","h":"6pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"3pt","leftB":"3pt","rightT":"3pt","rightB":"3pt"},"bgColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(${_p},1),if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${_it.s},5),3),0,1),0)]"},"react":[{"type":"layer","x":"56pt","y":"${_ry}pt+6pt","w":"({parent.w}-136pt)*${_p}/100","h":"6pt","cornerRadius":{"leftT":"3pt","leftB":"3pt","rightT":"3pt","rightB":"3pt"},"bgColor":"#FF5C4D|#FF7A66"}]},{"type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-72pt","y":"${_ry}pt","w":"56pt","h":"18pt","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${_it.c},0)]","fontSize":"11pt","alignmentH":"2","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#0E1116|#F3F4F6","maxLines":"1","alignmentV":"1"}]},{"type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"{parent.h}-24pt","w":"{parent.w}-32pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.foot1} ${_n} ${@i18n.foot2} $[findNotEmpty::(${rvAvg},--)]","fontSize":"9.5pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(${_n},1),0,1)]"},"react":[{"type":"txt","x":"16pt","y":"24pt","w":"{parent.w}-32pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.empty}","fontSize":"11pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"foot1":"最新","foot2":"条评论 · 均分","empty":"暂时没有拿到这个地区的评论"},"en-US":{"foot1":"Latest","foot2":"reviews · avg","empty":"No reviews available for this storefront right now"}}}}
